    },
    "A live clock whose aurora background follows the light of day. Also sits on your lock screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A live clock whose aurora background follows the light of day. Also sits on your lock screen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aurora arka planı günün ışığını takip eden canlı bir saat. Kilit ekranında da durur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A live deep-work timer. Start it, and the countdown follows you to the lock screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A live deep-work timer. Start it, and the countdown follows you to the lock screen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Canlı bir derin çalışma sayacı. Başlat, geri sayım kilit ekranına kadar seninle gelsin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passage a day, from the source you choose — scripture, Stoic philosophy, poetry or proverbs. Always shown with its reference." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A passage a day, from the source you choose — scripture, Stoic philosophy, poetry or proverbs. Always shown with its reference."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seçtiğin kaynaktan günde bir alıntı — kutsal metin, stoacı felsefe, şiir ya da atasözü. Her zaman kaynağıyla birlikte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Turkish proverb or idiom every four hours, with its meaning and an example. From 400 sayings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Turkish proverb or idiom every four hours, with its meaning and an example. From 400 sayings."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Her dört saatte bir atasözü ya da deyim, anlamı ve örnek cümlesiyle. 400 söz arasından."
          }
        }
      }
    },
